E711 [*] Comparison to `None` should be `cond is None`
 --> E711_E712_basedpython.by:4:20
  |
2 | # chain writes the identity spelling
3 | def chains(a: int | None, b: int, c: bool) -> None:
4 |     print(b < a == None)  # E711
  |                    ^^^^
5 |     print(b < a != None)  # E711
6 |     print(b == c == False)  # E712
  |
help: Replace with `cond is None`
